<h2>Agent Registration Request Received</h2>

<p>Hello <strong><%= name || 'Agent' %></strong>,</p>

<p>Thank you for submitting your agent registration details. We have received your request and will verify your information shortly.</p>

<p>Your request ID is <strong><%= requestId %></strong>.</p>

<p>Until the verification process is complete, your profile status remains <strong>Pending</strong> and your agent access is not active.</p>

<p>We will notify you by email once your agent profile is approved.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
<strong>The Waridi Team</strong></p>
